OL,3,GNEWSANew council leader named after
OL,4,Apredecessor convicted
OL,5,
OL,6,FSamantha Deakin has been named the new
OL,7,Fleader of Ashfield District Council
OL,8,Fafter the authority's previous leader
OL,9,Fwas convicted of fraud and tax evasion.
OL,11,FJason Zadrozny was found guilty last
OL,12,Fweek and announced his resignation as
OL,13,Fleader the following day.
OL,15,FDeakin, who represents Sutton Central
OL,16,Fand New Cross for the Ashfield
OL,17,FIndependents, was elected as Zadrozny's
OL,18,Freplacement at a meeting on Monday by
OL,19,F21 votes to one, with one abstention.
OL,21,FDeakin declined the BBC's request for
OL,22,Fan interview.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
